#: format_and_set_srv.sh:21
msgid "Another formatting job currently in progress, not switching to new drive."
msgstr "Muu vormindamine on hetkel pooleli ja uut ketast ei saa kasutada."

#: format_and_set_srv.sh:38
msgid "Formatting drive failed, try unpluging it and repluging it in again."
msgstr "Ketta vormindamine ei õnnestunud, proovi ta eemaldada ja tagasi panna."

#: format_and_set_srv.sh:41
msgid "Can't get UUID of your newly formatted drive."
msgstr "Justvormindatud ketta UUID tuvastamine ei õnnestu."

#: format_and_set_srv.sh:47
msgid "Can't find your current srv location."
msgstr "Sinu praeguse „srv“ asukoha tuvastamine ei õnnestu."

#: format_and_set_srv.sh:54
msgid ""
"Your new disk for storing data has been setup successfully. All you need to "
"do now is to reboot your router for changes to take effect. Be aware that if "
"you have some local data stored on your current storage, those will get moved "
"during reboot, so your next reboot might take quite some time."
msgstr ""
"Sinu uus andmesalvestusketas on edukalt seadistatud. Et muudatused "
"jõustuksis, pead nüüd vaid ruuteri taaskäivitama. Pane tähele, et kui sinu "
"praegusel salvestusseadmel on kohalikke andmeid, siis need viiakse "
"taaskäivitamise käigus üle, mistõttu järgmine taaskäivitamine võib võtta "
"üsna kaua aega."

#: srv.init:38
msgid ""
"Moving files failed, please check manually what went wrong and what files were "
"left on your old drive."
msgstr ""
"Failide teisaldamine ei õnnestunud. Palun kontrolli käsitsi, mis läks "
"valesti ja millised failid jäid vanale kettale."

#: generate-lxc.sh:38
msgid "Distribution %1 version %2 was just installed as a container."
msgstr "„%1“ distributsiooni „%2“ versioon sai just paigaldatud konteinerina."

#: generate-lxc.sh:40
msgid ""
"Content of the tarballs is provided by third party, thus there is no warranty "
"of any kind nor support from Turris team."
msgstr ""
"Tar-faili sisu on loodud kolmanda osapoole poolt ja seega Turrise tiim ei "
"saa pakkuda mitte mingit kasutajatuge ega garantiid."

#: generate-lxc.sh:42
msgid ""
"Do not use containers on internal flash, they can wear it down really fast!!!"
msgstr ""
"Ära kasuta konteinereid sisemisel välkmälul - sa võid sedaviisi andmekandja "
"kiiresti ära kulutada!!!"

#: foris/config/__init__.py:246
msgid "This is a testing notification. Please ignore me."
msgstr "See on testteavitus. Palun eira mind."
